OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 17 MAY
OL,4,G1200FPrivate Passions
OL,5,     GMichael Berkeley's guest is the
OL,6,     Ghistorian and broadcaster Michael
OL,7,     GWood.
OL,8,G1330FMusic Map
OL,9,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch hits the
OL,10,     Gdancefloor, exploring the world
OL,11,     Gof Marquez's Danzon No 2.
OL,12,     GFeaturing Latin American
OL,13,     Ginfluences, unofficial national
OL,14,     Ganthems and even the theme from
OL,15,     GBluey.
OL,16,G1500FMusic Matters: Musical Minds
OL,17,     GPsychotherapist and broadcaster
OL,18,     GNemone Metaxas is joined by
OL,19,     Gconductor Lidiya Yankovskaya to
OL,20,     Gdelve into our relationship with
OL,21,     Gmusic and untangle why it means
OL,22,     Gso much to us.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
