OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 17 MAY
OL,4,G1600FJazz Record Requests
OL,5,     GAlyn Shipton presents jazz
OL,6,     Grecords of all styles as
OL,7,     Grequested by you including
OL,8,     Gselections from Oscar Peterson,
OL,9,     GMahavishnu Orchestra, Irene Kral
OL,10,     Gand Eva Cassidy.
OL,11,G1700FThe Early Music Show
OL,12,     GHannah French explores Heinrich
OL,13,     GSchutz's 26 psalm settings, which
OL,14,     Gwere one of the first major
OL,15,     Gcollections of choral music in
OL,16,     Gthe German language.
OL,17,G1800FChoral Evensong
OL,18,     GLive from Bristol Cathedral on
OL,19,     Gthe Eve of the Ascension, with
OL,20,     Gmusic by Stanford, Jonathan Dove,
OL,21,     GFinzi and Laurin.
